 "variant_designations": {
  "_about": "PR #43: regular expressions (over normalized, lower-case text) of engine / powertrain VERSION designations a document uses to tell versions of one model apart ('55 TFSI e', '40TFSI', 'TFSIe', '4xe', 'P400'). A designation is written into a region's identity (src/variant_map.identity_vector, key `designation`, compact form '55tfsie'); two regions with different designations are never the same variant; a hybrid / plug-in document that names two or more designations (or states two or more distinct powers) never identifies the variant by displacement alone (document_binding.bind, H1). Generic patterns only, never a model name.",
  "patterns": [
   "(?<![\\w.,])\\d{2}\\s?-?(?:tfsi|tsi|tdi|tfsie)(?:\\s?e(?![a-z]))?(?![a-z0-9])",
   "(?<![\\w.,])\\dxe(?![a-z0-9])",
   "(?<![\\w.,])p\\d{3}e?(?![a-z0-9])"
  ]
 },
