  "_about": "PR #43 (H2): comparative references to ANOTHER version of the model. A value whose own clause uses one ('the more senior one adds 22\" wheels') is about that other version: heading-level evidence (a section heading, the document's trim) never binds it to a trim or technical variant; it binds at most body_powertrain (binding flag relative_variant_reference).",
